{"metadata":{"role":"project","categoryPathComponent":"Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","category":"Orange Unified Design System","title":"Use your first OUDS components"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"project","variants":[{"paths":["\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[{"kind":"hero","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS provides components ready to be used, specified in Figma assets and preventing users to handle tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"They are rendered thanks to the theme in use.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"backgroundImage":"ic_component_intro.png","projectFiles":"OUDS-Discovery-Tutorial.zip","chapter":"Use of first components provided by OUDS","estimatedTimeInMinutes":30,"image":"ic_component_intro.png","xcodeRequirement":"Xcode 26.5","title":"Use your first OUDS components"},{"kind":"tasks","tasks":[{"stepsSection":[{"runtimePreview":null,"type":"step","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"First, prepare the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ContentView"},{"type":"text","text":" by adding inside it a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ScrollView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"caption":[],"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-1.swift","media":null},{"runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-2.png","type":"step","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Now, let’s add radio buttons to let the user choose its gender."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The official components are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadio"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":", but the package has also a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSRadioPicker"},{"type":"text","text":" to implement quicky a group of radios."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This component can be replaced by your own.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The radio picker is defined by an array of values to display radio items associated to a tag, i.e. an ","type":"text"},{"code":"Hashable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" thing shared through a ","type":"text"},{"code":"Binding","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Inside a picker the user can select only one value, not zero.","type":"text"}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add such picker with three items inside."}]}],"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-2.swift","media":null},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.swift","runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-3.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The radio picker is alone, it is the time to add below a checkbox. OUDS provides two components: ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSCheckbox","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" which is a simple checkbox, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSCheckboxItem","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" which is a checkbox (duh!) with additional texts and icons.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The state of the checkbox is shared through a boolean ","type":"text"},{"code":"State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In some cases you may need to use ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSCheckboxIndeterminate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSCheckboxItemIndeterminate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" if you want a three-states checkbox.","type":"text"}]}],"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a checkbox item with only two states."}]}],"media":null,"type":"step"},{"code":"tutorial-discovery-3-4.swift","runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-4.png","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"There are also components who do not have any behaviors and are here only for visual rendering, for example dividers which can be horizontal or vertical."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A divider is, in the end, a stroke with a color. You will see later, colors in OUDS have two values: a light mode value, and a dark mode value. Here the divider can have a color which can change, or not."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Choose to add an instance of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSHorizontalDivider"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"media":null,"type":"step"},{"media":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add a switch item, it will be used as a trick to force the change of the color scheme for the view for our future operations."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You will then be able to see the automatic changes of colors when you switch the color scheme."}]}],"type":"step","code":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.swift","runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-5.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"With radio and checkbox, OUDS provides also switch elements (toggles). They can be alone (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwitch"},{"text":") or with texts (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSSwitchItem"},{"text":").","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Just like the checkbox, the switch exposes its state through a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Binding"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"media":null,"caption":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an "},{"code":"OUDSLink","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app and make it open the iOS documentation OUDS website."}]}],"type":"step","code":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.swift","runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-6.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Users may need to navigate outside the app, like, for example, opening a website. Thus the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSLink","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" component can be integrated. It can be only with a text or also a chevron indicator.","type":"text"}]}]},{"media":null,"caption":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Let’s add a button with some rules: if checkbox is not checked it is disabled. When tapped, change the style of the button during 5 seconds."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"step","code":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.swift","runtimePreview":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.png","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In the end, we can also add a button. Button are one of the most used components in an app and bring a lof of the power and the style of the brand.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can find it with the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSButton"},{"type":"text","text":". Such button has an appearance changing its colors, and also a style (loading or not)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Thanks to the theme, the enabled, disabled, hover, focus or pressed states are managed."}]}]}],"contentSection":[{"mediaPosition":"trailing","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"We will work on a kind of formular using main OUDS components.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Feel free to style and design things as you want.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"contentAndMedia"}],"title":"Add basic components","anchor":"Add-basic-components"}]},{"kind":"assessments","anchor":"Check-Your-Understanding","assessments":[{"type":"multiple-choice","title":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Does the developer using OUDS component need to manage the look and feel of the components?"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"content":[],"choices":[{"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No! The components use the design specifications, i.e. tokens, thanks to the theme, to define the style they must have in all cases."}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes"}]}],"isCorrect":false},{"justification":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"That is the reason why the ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is so important: it injects the theme as environment variable so that any component can get it to define its style.","type":"text"}]}],"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}]}],"isCorrect":true}]}]},{"kind":"callToAction","title":"Add more OUDS components","action":{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"overridingTitle":"Get started","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","overridingTitleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Get started"}]},"featuredEyebrow":"Tutorial","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs."}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/$volume","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS"]],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)","modules":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies","projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies","sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Import-the-Swift-Package-and-the-libraries"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-1-package-and-librairies#Check-Your-Understanding"}]}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Preparation-of-the-theme","projects":[{"sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Basic-structure-for-the-app","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-2-instanciate-theme"}]},{"projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components","sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Add-basic-components","kind":"task"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-3-use-first-components#Check-Your-Understanding"}]}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Use-of-first-components-provided-by-OUDS"},{"projects":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","sections":[{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Add-basic-components","kind":"task"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components#Check-Your-Understanding","kind":"assessment"}]}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Richer-and-more-original-components-of-OUDS"},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens","projects":[{"sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-tokens"},{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-view-modifiers"},{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Final-result"},{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Want-to-be-an-artist"},{"kind":"assessment","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Check-Your-Understanding"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things"}]},{"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Go-further-with-more-ressources","projects":[{"sections":[{"kind":"task","reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further#More-resources"}],"reference":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-6-going-further"}]}]},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Go-further-with-more-ressources":{"role":"article","title":"Go further with more ressources","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Go-further-with-more-ressources","kind":"article","url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/go-further-with-more-ressources","abstract":[]},"ic_component_intro.png":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesContract\/ic_component_intro.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","alt":"OUDS components logo","identifier":"ic_component_intro.png"},"tutorial-discovery-3-7.swift":{"fileName":"Content.swift","identifier":"tutorial-discovery-3-7.swift","type":"file","fileType":"swift","syntax":"swift","content":["import OUDSSwiftUI","import SwiftUI","","struct ContentView: View {","","    @State var selectedGender: Genders = .male","    @State var termsAccepted: Bool = false","    @State var switchToDarkMode: Bool = false","    @State var creatingProfile: Bool = false","","    @Environment(\\.openURL) var openUrl","","    var body: some View {","        VStack {","            OUDSRadioPicker(selection: $selectedGender,","                            radios: genderRadioValues(),","                            placement: .horizontal(false))","","            OUDSHorizontalDivider(color: .brandPrimary)","","            OUDSCheckboxItem(\"I accept the terms of use\", isOn: $termsAccepted)","","            OUDSSwitchItem(\"Switch to dark mode\", isOn: $switchToDarkMode)","","            OUDSLink(text: \"Go to the website\", indicator: .next) {","                openUrl.callAsFunction(URL(string: \"https:\/\/ios.unified-design-system.orange.com\")!)","            }","","            OUDSButton(text: \"Create my profile\",","                       appearance: .strong,","                       style: creatingProfile ? .loading : .default)","            {","                creatingProfile = true","                DispatchQueue.main.asyncAfter(deadline: .now() + 5) {","                    creatingProfile = false","                }","            }.disabled(!termsAccepted)","        }.preferredColorScheme(switchToDarkMode ? .dark : .light)","    }","","    \/\/ MARK: - Utils","","    enum Genders: String, Hashable {","        case male","        case female","        case nonBinary","    }","","    func genderRadioValues() -> [OUDSRadioPickerData<Genders>] {","        [","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.male, label: \"Mr\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.female, label: \"Ms\"),","            OUDSRadioPickerData(tag: Genders.nonBinary, label: \"Other\"),","        ]","    }","}"],"highlights":[{"line":9},{"line":28},{"line":29},{"line":30},{"line":31},{"line":32},{"line":33},{"line":34},{"line":35},{"line":36},{"line":37}]},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-view-modifiers":{"title":"Use of view modifiers","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-view-modifiers","abstract":[{"text":"Even if components increase the identity of your apps, it is not enough. Typography, fonts and tokens are here to improve that.","type":"text"}],"type":"section","kind":"section","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-5-styling-things#Use-of-view-modifiers","role":"pseudoSymbol"},"Xcode 26.5":{"type":"xcodeRequirement","title":"Xcode 26.5","url":"https:\/\/developer.apple.com\/download\/","identifier":"Xcode 26.5"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/OUDSThemesContract/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components":{"estimatedTime":"30min","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Components can be similar to iOS native components, or can also be original and strongly related to Orange Unified Design System needs."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","url":"\/tutorials\/oudsthemescontract\/tutorial-discovery-4-use-other-components","role":"project","type":"topic","title":"Add more OUDS components","kind":"project"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens":{"role":"article","title":"Typography, view modifiers and tokens","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/tutorials\/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)\/Typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens","kind":"article","abstract":[],"url":"\/tutorials\/table-of-contents-(discovery)\/typography,-view-modifiers-and-tokens"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/tutorials/Table-Of-Contents-(discovery)/Import-of-the-Swift-Package-and-choose-its-librairies":{"role":"article","title":"Import 